[HYP-C1] L(C) vs decorrelated floor (6/7)^|C|, and the depression D=floor-L:
   C                |C|   (6/7)^|C|   L(C)exact   depress D  D/floor
   {1,2,3}            3     0.62974     0.69048    -0.06074   -0.096
   {1,2,3,4,5}        5     0.46266     0.50476    -0.04210   -0.091
